{
  "id": "universal-shield-drop",
  "name": "Shield drop",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Drop through a platform out of shield",
  "why": "Shielding on a platform, {char} would otherwise have to jump out of shield, or let go of the shield and wait out its release. A shield drop puts {char} in the air below the platform at once, so an aerial can follow straight out of shield.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A shield drop is a drop through a platform straight out of shield, with the control stick pushed down part way.",
    "expect": "Each shield is judged when {char} leaves it: a drop through the platform, or something else. After misses, the coach shows your shield and the stick frame by frame.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 20
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -0.68
        ],
        "frame": 10,
        "hold": 5
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: R pressed: shield",
      "10": "Frame 10: stick down part way: through the platform"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Down through a platform",
        "text": [
          "On a platform, the control stick pushed down quickly drops {char} through it. The game takes the stick at 0.66 of its reach or further, reached within 6 frames of leaving the centre. Pushed down slowly, it only crouches.",
          "Standing, {char} crouches first and drops through 3 frames later."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 6
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: stick down: crouch",
              "4": "Frame 4: through the platform"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  3
                ],
                "words": "Crouch",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  12
                ],
                "words": "Through the platform",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Down in shield",
        "text": [
          "In shield, the stick down does one of two things, and the game checks the spot dodge first. Reaching 0.70 or further within 4 frames of leaving the centre is a spot dodge. Reaching 0.66 or further within 6 frames, and short of 0.70, drops {char} through the platform: a shield drop.",
          "The band between 0.66 and 0.70 is three of the stick's 80 steps. A stick that reaches 0.70 only on the 5th or 6th frame after leaving the centre also drops: the spot dodge's 4 frames have passed and the drop's 6 have not."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 20
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -0.68
                ],
                "frame": 10,
                "hold": 5
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: R pressed: shield",
              "10": "Frame 10: stick down to 0.675: through the platform"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  9
                ],
                "words": "Shield",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  10,
                  10
                ],
                "words": "Down part way: shield drop",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  11,
                  20
                ],
                "words": "Through the platform",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "On a platform",
      "stage": "battlefield",
      "player": {
        "x": -40,
        "above": 40
      },
      "opponent": "none",
      "camera": {
        "follow": "player",
        "distance": 220,
        "height": 10
      }
    }
  ],
  "attempt": {
    "start": {
      "enters": "shield"
    },
    "judge": [
      {
        "leaves": "shield"
      }
    ]
  },
  "measures": {
    "dropped": {
      "happened": {
        "enters": "platform_drop"
      }
    },
    "from_shield": {
      "happened": {
        "enters": "platform_drop",
        "from": "shield"
      }
    },
    "shielded": {
      "frames_while": {
        "in": "shield"
      },
      "from": "start"
    },
    "spot_dodged": {
      "happened": {
        "enters": "spot_dodge"
      }
    }
  },
  "verdict": {
    "success": "Shield drop after {shielded_frames} in shield."
  },
  "checks": {
    "dropped": {
      "measure": "dropped",
      "equals": true,
      "expect": "Drop through the platform",
      "words": "stayed on the platform",
      "headline": "No drop",
      "fix": "Push the control stick down quickly, from the centre to 0.66 or further within 6 frames. Pushed slowly, {char} only crouches."
    },
    "no spot dodge": {
      "measure": "spot_dodged",
      "equals": false,
      "expect": "No spot dodge",
      "words": "the stick reached 0.70 within 4 frames of leaving the centre",
      "headline": "Spot dodge",
      "fix": "Push the stick down less far, short of 0.70. A push that reaches 0.70 only on the 5th or 6th frame after leaving the centre also drops."
    },
    "from shield": {
      "measure": "from_shield",
      "equals": true,
      "expect": "Drop through the platform out of shield",
      "words": "left the shield without dropping through",
      "headline": "No shield drop",
      "fix": "Push the stick down to 0.66 or further within 6 frames of leaving the centre. Short of 0.66, {char} stays in shield."
    }
  },
  "parts": [
    {
      "name": "Drop through",
      "teach": "On the platform, tap the control stick down. {char} crouches and drops through it.",
      "example": [
        {
          "stick": [
            0,
            -1
          ],
          "frame": 1,
          "hold": 6
        }
      ],
      "marks": {
        "1": "Frame 1: stick down: crouch",
        "4": "Frame 4: through the platform"
      },
      "attempt": {
        "start": [
          {
            "enters": "squat"
          },
          {
            "enters": "shield"
          }
        ],
        "judge": [
          {
            "enters": "platform_drop"
          },
          {
            "leaves": "squat",
            "on_ground": true
          },
          {
            "leaves": "shield",
            "on_ground": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "checks": [
        "dropped"
      ],
      "success": "Dropped through the platform.",
      "streak": 2,
      "coach": {
        "rows": [
          {
            "label": "Down",
            "stick": "down",
            "perfect": []
          },
          {
            "label": "Crouch",
            "state": "squat",
            "held": true,
            "perfect": []
          },
          {
            "label": "Drop",
            "state": "platform_drop",
            "perfect": []
          }
        ],
        "note": "The stick must go from the centre to 0.66 or further within 6 frames."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Out of shield",
      "teach": "Hold R or L to shield, then push the control stick down part way: 0.66 or further, short of 0.70. {char} drops straight out of shield.",
      "example": [
        {
          "press": "R",
          "frame": 1,
          "hold": 20
        },
        {
          "stick": [
            0,
            -0.68
          ],
          "frame": 10,
          "hold": 5
        }
      ],
      "marks": {
        "1": "Frame 1: R pressed: shield",
        "10": "Frame 10: stick down to 0.675: through the platform"
      },
      "cues": [
        {
          "frames": [
            10,
            10
          ],
          "words": "Down part way: shield drop",
          "kind": "go"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        "no spot dodge",
        "from shield"
      ],
      "streak": 3
    }
  ],
  "mistakes": [
    {
      "name": "crouched slowly",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "stick": [
            0,
            -0.5
          ],
          "frame": 1,
          "hold": 7
        },
        {
          "stick": [
            0,
            -1
          ],
          "frame": 8,
          "hold": 5
        }
      ],
      "fails": "dropped"
    },
    {
